---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_results: resultsPublished == true
    q_check_results --> q_check_not_claimed: excessCapitalClaimed[msg.sender] == false
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_verify_proof: verify merkleProof against acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot for (msg.sender, acceptedAmount)
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_excess: excessAmount = investedCapital[msg.sender] - acceptedAmount
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_positive: excessAmount > 0?
    q_check_positive --> q_mark_claimed: excessCapitalClaimed[msg.sender] = true
    q_mark_claimed --> q_transfer: bidToken.transfer(msg.sender, excessAmount)
    q_transfer --> [*]: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn event

    q_check_positive --> q_revert_no_excess: excessAmount == 0
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not published
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: excessAmount = investedCapital - acceptedAmount (no rounding)
        INV-002: each investor can withdraw excess exactly once
        INV-003: acceptedAmount verified via merkle proof (cannot be forged)
        INV-004: sum of all excess withdrawals <= totalCapitalInvested - totalCapitalAccepted
    end note
